{"seq":1,"slug":"threat-model","title":"前端威胁模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security-engineering/foundations/threat-model","wordCount":1826,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"前端威胁模型\">前端威胁模型</h1><p>一个常见的误区是把前端安全等同于&quot;输入校验加几个安全响应头&quot;。真正的威胁建模要逆向思考：站在攻击者一侧，问清楚他想要什么、能控制什么、从哪里下手。前端的特殊之处在于，它的全部代码都运行在攻击者完全掌控的设备上——用户的浏览器既可能是受害者，也可能就是攻击者本人。你下发的每一行 JavaScript、每一个隐藏字段、每一段注释，攻击者都能读到、改写、重放。因此前端绝不能把任何客户端校验当作安全边界，它至多是体验优化；真正的信任边界在服务端。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>威胁模型是对&quot;系统会面对哪些攻击、攻击者具备何种能力&quot;的结构化描述。它由四个要素构成：<strong>资产</strong>（值得保护的东西，如用户会话、个人数据、支付能力）、<strong>攻击者</strong>（其动机与能力，从脚本小子到有组织的供应链攻击者）、<strong>攻击面</strong>（攻击者可触达的所有输入与接口）、<strong>信任边界</strong>（数据从一个信任级别跨入另一个的位置，每一次跨越都需要校验）。</p>\n<p>下图是一个典型前端应用的信任边界与数据流：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[攻击者控制的输入&lt;br/&gt;URL/表单/postMessage/第三方脚本] --&gt; B{信任边界 1&lt;br/&gt;进入前端}&#10;  B --&gt; C[前端 JS 处理&lt;br/&gt;渲染/路由/状态]&#10;  C --&gt; D{信任边界 2&lt;br/&gt;DOM 写入}&#10;  D --&gt; E[浏览器 DOM/执行环境]&#10;  C --&gt; F{信任边界 3&lt;br/&gt;发往服务端}&#10;  F --&gt; G[服务端校验与持久化]&#10;  G --&gt; H[(数据库/下游服务)]&#10;  E -.窃取会话.-&gt; A\">flowchart TD\n  A[攻击者控制的输入&lt;br/&gt;URL/表单/postMessage/第三方脚本] --&gt; B{信任边界 1&lt;br/&gt;进入前端}\n  B --&gt; C[前端 JS 处理&lt;br/&gt;渲染/路由/状态]\n  C --&gt; D{信任边界 2&lt;br/&gt;DOM 写入}\n  D --&gt; E[浏览器 DOM/执行环境]\n  C --&gt; F{信任边界 3&lt;br/&gt;发往服务端}\n  F --&gt; G[服务端校验与持久化]\n  G --&gt; H[(数据库/下游服务)]\n  E -.窃取会话.-&gt; A</pre><p>每一个菱形都是一处必须做校验或编码的关口。前端工程师最容易犯的错，是默认&quot;信任边界 1&quot;内的数据已经干净，于是在&quot;信任边界 2&quot;直接把它写进 DOM——这正是 <a href=\"../injection/xss\">跨站脚本 XSS</a> 的温床。</p>\n<p>下表对比了前端面临的几类攻击者及其典型手段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>攻击者类型</th>\n<th>动机</th>\n<th>典型能力</th>\n<th>主要攻击面</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>外部匿名攻击者</td>\n<td>窃取数据、滥用功能</td>\n<td>构造恶意 URL、提交恶意输入</td>\n<td>反射型 XSS、CSRF、参数篡改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已登录的恶意用户</td>\n<td>越权、横向移动</td>\n<td>持有合法会话、可调任意 API</td>\n<td>存储型 XSS、IDOR、客户端校验绕过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络中间人</td>\n<td>窃听、篡改流量</td>\n<td>控制不安全网络</td>\n<td>明文 HTTP、会话劫持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应链攻击者</td>\n<td>大规模植入后门</td>\n<td>控制依赖包或 CDN</td>\n<td>恶意 npm 包、被劫持的脚本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钓鱼/社工攻击者</td>\n<td>诱导用户操作</td>\n<td>搭建仿冒页面</td>\n<td>点击劫持、开放重定向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"stride-把攻击面拆开\">STRIDE：把攻击面拆开</h2><p>STRIDE 是微软提出的威胁分类法，用六个首字母覆盖六类威胁，套用到前端能强迫你把每个组件逐项过一遍，避免凭直觉漏项。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>S（Spoofing，仿冒身份）</strong>：攻击者冒充用户或服务。前端对应的是会话固定、令牌泄露、钓鱼。防御依赖可靠的 <a href=\"../session/auth-tokens-cookies\">认证令牌与 Cookie</a> 设计。</li>\n<li><strong>T（Tampering，篡改）</strong>：篡改传输中或存储中的数据。前端对应隐藏字段篡改、本地存储被改、中间人篡改脚本。</li>\n<li><strong>R（Repudiation，抵赖）</strong>：用户否认做过某操作。前端需配合服务端审计日志，关键操作走二次确认。</li>\n<li><strong>I（Information Disclosure，信息泄露）</strong>：敏感数据意外暴露。前端高发区是 <a href=\"../engineering/secrets-data-exposure\">密钥与数据泄露</a>——硬编码密钥、源码映射、错误信息过详。</li>\n<li><strong>D（Denial of Service，拒绝服务）</strong>：前端对应客户端资源耗尽、正则灾难性回溯、无节流的重渲染。</li>\n<li><strong>E（Elevation of Privilege，权限提升）</strong>：低权用户获得高权能力。XSS 之所以最危险，正因为它直接把攻击者提升到&quot;在用户身份下任意执行脚本&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这六类逐一映射到应用的每个数据入口，就能得到一张相对完整的威胁清单，再据此排优先级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dread-与风险排序\">DREAD 与风险排序</h2><p>列出威胁只是第一步，资源有限时必须排序。DREAD 给每个威胁在五个维度打分（通常 1–10），再取均值或加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Risk</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>damage</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>repro</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>exploit</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>affected</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>discover</mtext></msub></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Risk} = \\frac{D_{\\text{damage}} + R_{\\text{repro}} + E_{\\text{exploit}} + A_{\\text{affected}} + D_{\\text{discover}}}{5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Risk</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">damage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">repro</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">exploit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">affected</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">discover</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>damage</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{damage}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">damage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是危害程度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>repro</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{repro}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">repro</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是可复现性，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mtext>exploit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\text{exploit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">exploit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是利用难度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>affected</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{\\text{affected}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">affected</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是受影响用户范围，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>discover</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_{\\text{discover}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">discover</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是被发现的可能性。一个存储型 XSS 通常在危害、影响范围、可复现性上都接近满分，因此几乎永远排在修复队列最前面。需要提醒的是 DREAD 的打分主观性强，更适合做团队内部的相对排序，而非绝对的安全度量。</p>\n<p>OWASP Top 10 也是一份现成的&quot;行业级&quot;优先级参考。在 2025 版中，注入类（含 XSS）从 2021 年的第 3 位下滑到第 5 位，而&quot;软件供应链失败&quot;首次以独立类别空降第 3 位——这意味着前端团队的威胁建模必须把依赖与构建链纳入核心，详见 <a href=\"../engineering/dependency-supply-chain\">依赖与供应链安全</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前端特有的攻击面清单\">前端特有的攻击面清单</h2><p>通用威胁模型套到前端，有几处是后端工程师容易忽视的入口，建模时务必逐一覆盖：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>URL 与查询参数</strong>：反射型 XSS、开放重定向、参数污染的主入口。</li>\n<li><strong>DOM 与客户端路由</strong>：单页应用直接操作 DOM，<code>location.hash</code>、<code>history.state</code> 都是 DOM 型 XSS 的源。</li>\n<li><strong>postMessage 与跨窗口通信</strong>：未校验 <code>event.origin</code> 会让任意页面向你注入数据，详见 <a href=\"same-origin-policy\">同源策略与 CORS</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>第三方脚本与依赖</strong>：广告、分析、SDK 在你的源里以你的权限运行，一旦被劫持等同于自家 XSS。</li>\n<li><strong>本地存储</strong>：<code>localStorage</code> / <code>sessionStorage</code> 中的令牌可被任意同源脚本读取，因此 XSS 与令牌存储策略强相关。</li>\n<li><strong>iframe 嵌入关系</strong>：既要防别人把你嵌进去（<a href=\"../session/clickjacking-framing\">点击劫持</a>），也要管好你嵌入的不可信内容。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"威胁建模的工作流\">威胁建模的工作流</h2><p>威胁建模不是一次性文档，而是嵌入研发流程的循环活动。一个轻量但有效的节奏是：在设计阶段画出数据流图、标出信任边界；用 STRIDE 对每个边界穿越点提问；对得到的威胁用 DREAD 或 OWASP 风险评级排序；为高优先级威胁指定缓解措施并落到具体的代码或配置；最后在评审与渗透测试中验证缓解是否真正生效。每次架构变更——新增一个第三方 SDK、改动认证流程、开放一个新的跨域接口——都应触发对受影响部分的重新建模。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>前端代码运行在攻击者可完全掌控的环境，客户端校验只是体验优化，真正的信任边界在服务端。</li>\n<li>威胁模型由资产、攻击者、攻击面、信任边界四要素构成；每一次数据跨越信任边界都是必须校验或编码的关口。</li>\n<li>STRIDE 帮你系统枚举六类威胁，DREAD 与 OWASP Top 10 帮你对威胁排序；2025 年供应链已升至 OWASP 第 3 位。</li>\n<li>前端特有攻击面包括 URL、DOM、postMessage、第三方脚本、本地存储、iframe 嵌入关系，建模时务必逐一覆盖。</li>\n<li>威胁建模是嵌入研发流程的循环活动，每次架构变更都应触发重新建模。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>来源：OWASP Top 10:2025（owasp.org/Top10/2025）；Microsoft STRIDE 威胁建模方法论；OWASP Threat Modeling Cheat Sheet。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"前端威胁模型","id":"前端威胁模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"STRIDE：把攻击面拆开","id":"stride-把攻击面拆开"},{"level":2,"text":"DREAD 与风险排序","id":"dread-与风险排序"},{"level":2,"text":"前端特有的攻击面清单","id":"前端特有的攻击面清单"},{"level":2,"text":"威胁建模的工作流","id":"威胁建模的工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"同源策略与 CORS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-security-engineering/foundations/same-origin-policy"}}